# Implement 5-Phase Interactive Learning Strategy

This plan updates the TalkMate agent to use a newly designed 5-phase interactive learning strategy focused on task-based missions, natural error correction, and structured onboarding. It also resolves bugs related to call counting and implements a post-call summary.

