### Session Management & Call Handling

#### [MODIFY] [session_manager.py](file:///d:/PROJECTS/ANTIGRAVITY/english-telegram/sinhala-english-tutor/core/session_manager.py)
* **Fix `call_count` Logic**: Add an `increment_call: bool = False` argument to `get_or_create_session()`. The `call_count` bug occurs because sessions live in memory, so `is_new_session` is `False` incorrectly between subsequent calls.
* Add support for storing and loading `learning_targets` (list of strings or dicts) into the `UserStore` profile dict to ensure mistakes traverse sessions safely.

